  "details": "With the new accessory update and addition of the \"looks\" tab, the action menu feels a bit bloated. I think a toggle in settings or maybe in the inventory to choose whether or not a specific tab shows up in the action menu would be nice (with the exception of options and probably expressions). Such a feature would probably also make the stickers and emojis tabs easier to navigate too, at least for me personally as I don't have enough stickers or emojis to fill all the custom sticker or emoji tabs.",
